# Meadow School

Private family PA home-ed app (Expo web + iOS). Learners ages 3–7. Read root `AGENTS.md`.

## Must follow

- Meadow is a **conversational teacher agent** (`TeacherAgent` + `teachScript`), not a page reader.
- Keep answers grounded in lesson `groundingText` + exercises.
- Voice out via `lib/voice/meadowVoice.ts` + Supertonic on web (`lib/voice/supertonic.web.ts`, F2 default); mic via `lib/voice/listen.ts` when available.
- Lessons in `content/bands/*.ts` with PA tags; exercises use difficulty 1→2→3.
- Theme: `lib/theme.ts` (Storybook Meadow). No purple gradients; no cream+terracotta; no Inter defaults.
- Parent PIN; optional OpenAI key only via parent desk / SecureStore.

## Prefer

- Short teach → check → challenge turns over dumping block text.
- Local teacher fallback if no API key.
